 ${\cal C}_2$ is obtained by developing the elements of
$\bbZ_{21}$ in the following codewords $+3\pmod{21}$, and ${\cal
C}_6$ is obtained by developing the elements of $\bbZ_{57}$ in
the following codewords $+1\pmod{57}$.

