For $t\geq 85$, write $t=4u+17$ with $u \geq 17$. Take a $[3,1]$-GDC$(6)$ of type $36^u 153^1$ from Lemma~\ref{GDCa}, adjoin four ideal points, and fill in the groups to obtain an
optimal $(36u+157,6,[3,1])_3$-code.
